[2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231mIf the cook has typed into the form and later changes the Cookbook, what happens to what they typed?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mRe-fill everything (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mThe form starts over from the new book: title, servings, cuisine, note and source all come from it. Simple and predictable, since every field depends on the book, but typed text is lost.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Keep typed title and note
     [38;5;246mOnly fields the cook hasn't touched re-fill. Keeps work, but a title like 'Lemon pasta (1)' can end up in a different book, with a suffix that's now wrong.[39m
